<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Feb trade deficit revised to 328.0 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Feb trade deficit revised to 328.0 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's trade deficit in February was revised to 328.0 million Swiss francs from the 332.1 million gap first reported, the Federal Customs Office said. It gave these revised figures:</p>
<p> Balance  (million Sfr)	  - 328.0</p>
<p> Imports  (million Sfr)	  8,298.6</p>
<p> Exports  (million Sfr)	  7,970.6</p>
<p>Note - Original 332.1 million deficit, imports 8,298.0 million and exports 7,965.9 million. Figues exclude precious metals, precious stones, art objects and antiques.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
